cits_validator/asn1/standards/ contains ASN.1 modules taken from published specifications. They
are included only so that the conformance rule R06 can compile and decode PDUs. The per-file
origin (standard, version, source URL, SHA-256, licence) is recorded in
cits_validator/asn1/standards/manifest.json.

