2. ISO-authored text republished by ETSI - REDISTRIBUTION RIGHT UNCONFIRMED
   Three files contain text authored by ISO, obtained from the ETSI repository is_ts103301:
     - ISO-TS-19091-DSRC.raw.asn            (ISO/TS 19091)
     - ISO24534-3_ElectronicRegistrationIdentificationVehicleDataModule-patched.asn (ISO 24534-3;
       a modified copy as published by ETSI)
     - DSRC.asn                             (ETSI TS 103 301 v2.2.1, derived from ISO/TS 19091)
   ISO's own licence for these "electronic inserts" permits use in their original format without
   modification for the purposes of the standard (https://standards.iso.org/iso/ts/19091/). It does
