   The maintainer intends to ask ISO and ETSI to confirm redistribution (drafts in
   docs/legal/permission-requests.md). If that is refused, these files will be removed and fetched on demand instead.

3. IEEE 1609.2
   No IEEE 1609.2 ASN.1 module is included. cits_validator/core/secured.py reads the COER
   envelope structure directly.

